⚡🇺🇦 President Volodymyr Zelensky has ruled out former Interior Minister Ihor Klymenko as Ukraine's next defense minister and is interviewing other candidates, the Financial Times reports.

The FT also reports that Kyrylo Budanov is not currently being considered for the role, with Zelensky believing he is needed in his current position.

